    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95554a4c19effaaaaeb8ab26",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "机伶金花，\n最近越来越拼命了啊。\n感觉她周围的空气都变得凌厉起来了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ce43f4149c46d038446ef29ae4027d52b934cfa36ad8b5c89840eda11a957fe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
