      "uid": "zhcn:e58d965c7a5771bd842b78b4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了能够互相刺激、共同进步，\n并进行更贴近实战的训练，\n我安排了一次合同训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3b82b83ee0906c3e7fd46dff03508a0356ff0a33a33c7433515586d09d20468",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134204.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54763395f2c9b95a08cd70ba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "唯独爱你",
      "source_fingerprint": "9399f1eac3e90e02e56c05a130bf24bc0c3867f6772ed5a8ee1c325df7f0f243",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
